Identity: (λx.x) 5
  ((λx.x) 5)
  ->β 5
  = 5 (normal form)

Constant: ((λx.λy.x) a) b
  (((λx.(λy.x)) a) b)
  ->β (λy.a)
  ->β a
  = a (normal form)

Self-apply identity to identity: (λx.x x)(λy.y)
  ((λx.(x x)) (λy.y))
  ->β ((λy.y) (λy.y))
  ->β (λy.y)
  = (λy.y) (normal form)

Apply-twice: (λf.λx.f(f x)) g a
  (((λf.(λx.(f (f x)))) g) a)
  ->β (λx.(g (g x)))
  ->β (g (g a))
  = (g (g a)) (normal form)
